OL,3,GNEWSABrother of Kriss Donald killers   
OL,4,Aamong gang jailed for #600,000 fraud   
OL,5,Aplot                                   
OL,7,FThe High Court in Glasgow heard that   
OL,8,Fthe fraud plot saw victims being told  
OL,9,Ftheir accounts were at threat of       
OL,10,Fscammers, with Shahid and his          
OL,11,Fassociates securing cash, Rolex        
OL,12,Fwatches, designer clothes, Apple       
OL,13,Fproducts, and an e-bike.               
